-1.  **Initialization:**
-    -   `SectionStorage::default()` creates an `Empty` section (all `VoxelId::AIR`).
-    -   `SectionStorage::filled(id)` creates a `Uniform` section if `id != AIR`, or `Empty` if `id == AIR`. Heap capacity is 0.
